[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-harvard-university-mba-scholarship-by-boustany-foundation-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-104":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},104,"harvard-university-mba-scholarship-by-boustany-foundation-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-104","Harvard University Mba Scholarship By Boustany Foundation 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>The Harvard University Boustany Foundation Scholarship presents a golden opportunity for international students to embark on a transformative two-year journey at Harvard Business School, with the next class set to commence in Autumn 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Boustany Foundation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Harvard University, USA\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-usa\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-USA\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>$120,000 Fund\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel expenses\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: May 31, 2027\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Harvard University MBA Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Candidates aspiring for the Harvard University MBA Scholarship must meet the following criteria:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess an outstanding academic background demonstrating considerable promise.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>While the scholarship is open to candidates of any nationality, preference will be accorded to candidates of Lebanese descent.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants are eligible to apply for the scholarship after securing an offer of admission from the Harvard MBA program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Boustany Foundation MBA Scholarship Benefits and Timeline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Boustany Foundation Postgraduate Scholarship at Harvard University MBA program provides the following comprehensive benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Financial aid covering 75% of tuition fees.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel and accommodation expenses related to the internship are included.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Harvard University MBA Scholarship, sponsored by the Boustany Foundation, encompasses:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Financial aid totaling US$102,200 (US$51,100 per year) directed towards tuition fees.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Coverage of travel and accommodation expenses associated with the internship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Scholar program listings\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Successful candidates are anticipated to fulfill a two-month unpaid internship aligned with the Foundation’s activities or those of its partners. The projects during the internship are diverse, offering a rich experiential learning opportunity.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>How To Apply for Harvard University MBA Scholarship 2026 by Boustany Foundation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>To apply for this prestigious scholarship, interested candidates should forward a copy of their curriculum vitae along with a photograph, GMAT scores, and the acceptance letter from Harvard University to: \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"mailto:admissions@boustany-foundation.org\">\u003Cstrong>admissions@boustany-foundation.org\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Cstrong>.\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>If shortlisted, candidates may be invited for an interview with the Foundation. The final scholarship recipient will be announced during June 2025.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>For additional details and comprehensive information, prospective candidates can visit the official Harvard University website.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Embark on your transformative journey with the Boustany Foundation MBA Scholarship at Harvard University, shaping the next generation of global business leaders.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fboustany-foundation.org\u002Fscholarship-programmes\u002Fmba-harvard\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fboustany-foundation.org\u002Fscholarship-programmes\u002Fmba-harvard\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-27 11:55:00",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fharvard-university-mba-scholarship-by-boustany-foundation-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69c66204a4b974.75563604_screenshot 2026-03-27 113001.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fharvard-university-mba-scholarship-by-boustany-foundation-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69c66204a4b974.75563604_screenshot%202026-03-27%20113001.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":19,"url":45},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11